  m_text: 'Welcome to the first pre-alpha test of Critter Hunt!


    How to play:

    AWSD
    - movement

    E - interact

    Left Click - swing left hand weapon

    Right
    Click - use right hand item


    Esc - Main Menu

    I - Inventory

    Tab
    - Tool Inventory

    J - CritterDex


    Speak with your Auntie to get more
    info!

'
